 "notes": "Kept all four old kinds and added Dog boots, Dog life jacket and Dog car restraint. Trimmed SKU lists to market-covering brands and turned families into archetypes. Dropped as SKU noise: generic marketplace coats, beds and houses (FUAMEY, IECOii, JoyDaog, Kuoser, LelePet, Snuowu, Homey Pet, Aivituvin, Mirapet, Retriever, Rugged Ranch, TIAKI and Trixie repeats, etc.). Left out: Tuffies chew-proof bed (no page found); Hurtta Expedition Parka and Ruffwear Vert kept only as models (no product page retrieved); boot-guard, seat-cover and booster-seat brands (none retrieved); Kurgo car harness (2013 CPS study placed it low; no current certification found); years for iCrate, Vari/Sky Kennel, Grip Trex and Float Coat (not on retrieved pages). Blocked: businesswire.com (403), charleychau.com (503)."
}